{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2023-01-23 11:54:00', 'title': 'BOSTON SCIENTIFIC INVESTIGATION CONTINUED BY FORMER LOUISIANA ATTORNEY GENERAL: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC CONTINUES TO INVESTIGATE THE OFFICERS AND DIRECTORS OF BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORPORATION - BSX', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA, CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., ESQ., A PARTNER AT THE LAW FIRM OF KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC (“KSF”), ANNOUNCES THAT KSF CONTINUES ITS INVESTIGATION INTO BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: BSX).'}